    "title": "Pan-Roasted Chicken",
    "url": "../recipes/pan-roasted-chicken.html",
    "category": "Recipe",
    "excerpt": "Minimum safe core temperature for poultry: 165 F throughout. Probe every portion at the thickest part before it leaves the kitchen. Color is not a food safety indicator — always use a calibrated thermometer.",
